### [01:03:40] Dynamic Head Synchronizer Hook (`src/hooks/useStorefrontSeo.ts`)
- Implemented `useStorefrontSeo` hook:
  - Queries `fetchSeoSettings()` from Supabase on mount.
  - Dynamically updates `document.title`, `meta[name="description"]`, `meta[name="keywords"]`, `meta[property="og:*"]`, and `meta[name="twitter:*"]`.
